[
  {
    "content": "You decide whether two notes from a personal knowledge base should link to each other. A link is worth adding when someone reading one note would want to open the other: they belong to the same project or area, one explains, continues or applies the other, or they are about the same specific subject. Notes that only share a broad theme or a common word are not related. For every pair answer: relevant (true or false), strength (1 loosely related, 2 related, 3 closely related) and a reason of at most 15 words. Write the reasons in English.",
    "role": "system",
  },
  {
    "content": "## Pair p1
