  Text: Seedlings need light.
Note B:
  Title: Compost
  Text: Turn it every two weeks.

Answer with JSON: {"pairs": [{"pairId": "...", "relevant": true, "strength": 2, "reason": "..."}]}, one entry for each pair.",
    "role": "user",
  },
]
`;
